<title>UK: Nestle sets 300 mln mark bond due December 2001.</title>
<headline>Nestle sets 300 mln mark bond due December 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.  BORROWER   NESTLE HOLDING INC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    21.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.44    PAY DATE    29.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.69     SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
